      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The interrelationship between bulbar conjunctival microcirculation and coronary blood flow was studied in patients who had sustained myocardial infarction. It was shown that the trends in abnormal changes occurring in the cardiac vessels and their severity might be judged from microcirculatory alterations in the bulbar conjunctiva."},
